[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Quake
Comment=otQuake - framebuffer Quake
# The framebuffer build, fullscreen: piko-quake-x stops X, runs it on the
# console with a real input grab, and lets inittab respawn the desktop on
# exit. On this hardware that is the fastest thing available -- it writes
# /dev/fb0 with a vblank page flip and nothing else touches the screen.
#
# piko-quake-x11 is the alternative and keeps the Matchbox panel visible, but
# giving X the screen costs enough frame rate on a 400MHz PXA to not be the
# default. Swap the Exec line to try it.
#
# Absolute path on purpose: matchbox-desktop is started from inittab, whose
# PATH is /sbin:/usr/sbin:/bin:/usr/bin -- /etc/zaurus-card.sh is only sourced
# by login shells, so a bare name would not resolve here. The script itself
# reports a clear error when no card is inserted.
Exec=/mnt/card/.zaurus/usr/bin/piko-quake-x
Icon=mbnoapp.png
Terminal=false
Categories=Games;
